+        "Verify: Expected methods never called:\n"
+        "  0.  testMethod(1, 2) -> 'output'\n"
+        "  1.  testMethod(a=1, b=2, c='only named') -> None\n"
+        "  2.  testMethod2() -> 44\n"
+        "  3.  testMethod(1, 2) -> 'output'",
